s/2026/08/Web-banner-1920-x-720px-no-logo-1620x608.png 1620w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Web-banner-1920-x-720px-no-logo-768x288.png 768w, https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Web-banner-1920-x-720px-no-logo-1536x576.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />    <img width=\"560\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Web-banner-1920-x-720px-no-logo-560x700.png\" class=\"header_image_mobile\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></div><div class=\"margins\">\n        <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ol>\n            <li class=\"crumb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n                        <li class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"https://www.alexandrapalace.com/whats-on/\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>            <li class=\"crumb--current\">\n                <span aria-current=\"page\">Wallace &amp; Gromit with live brass band</span>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"event_content\" class=\"margins grid grid--3_1 component\">\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">\n        <h1>Wallace &amp; Gromit with live brass band</h1>\n            </div>      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n        <div class=\"event_details\"><p class=\"text-uppercase\">1 Nov 2026</p><p id=\"door-open-table-link\">Door Opening Times</p><p>Alexandra Palace Theatre</p></div>    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid--item grid--item--1\">      \n        <div class=\"ap_text_block\">\n    <p>Two different shows, three classic Wallace &amp; Gromit films, and the unforgettable music of <strong>Julian Nott</strong> performed live by one of the UK\u2019s leading brass bands &#8211; <strong>The KNDS Fairey Band</strong> at Alexandra Palace Theatre.</p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color: #003dc6;\">FAMILY TICKET DISCOUNT</span></b></p>\n<p>Apply promo code <strong>W&amp;GFAMILY25 </strong>and receive 25% off the combined price of both performances of the same price band. Applicable up to 2 adults &amp; 3 children.</p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color: #003dc6;\">14:00 &#8211; 15:30 SHOWING</span><br />\n</b><b>A Grand Day Out &amp; A Close Shave: </b><b><i>Live World Premiere</i></b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The first show is a very special Wallace &amp; Gromit double bill, beginning with </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A Grand Day Out</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2014 the original film that introduced audiences to Wallace &amp; Gromit. Watch as the pair build a homemade rocket and blast off to the moon in search of cheese.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Then comes a genuine Wallace &amp; Gromit first: the </span><b>world premiere live performance of </b><b><i>A Close Shave</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. For the first time ever, Julian Nott\u2019s original score for the film will be performed live alongside the action on screen.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wallace\u2019s window-cleaning round takes an unexpected turn when he falls for wool-shop owner Wendolene, while a woolly houseguest and a sinister dog soon add to the chaos.</span></p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color: #003dc6;\">16:30 &#8211; 17:40 SHOWING</span><br />\n</b><b>The Wrong Trousers Live</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Later in the afternoon, the band returns for a </span><b>separate performance </b>of <i>The Wrong Trousers</i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The show begins with a 25-minute mini concert with the band at its brilliant best, packed with virtuosic soloists and foot-tapping tunes, before Wallace &amp; Gromit take to the big screen.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Nick Park\u2019s Academy Award-winning classic, Wallace\u2019s latest invention \u2014 a pair of Techno Trousers \u2014 causes trouble when mysterious lodger Feathers McGraw arrives at 62 West Wallaby Street. What follows is a daring diamond robbery and the famous model-railway chase. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span></p>\n<p><strong>Age recommendation 5+</strong></p>\n</div><div class=\"section full_width bg_light_pink mobile_only\">\n            <div class=\"ap_carousel carousel--review\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                        <div class=\"ap_review_block\">\n                                                    \n                            <blockquote class=\"ap_quote palace color-blue\">\n                                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cThe score was immaculate. Every note was hit, every beat was smashed, and the audience applauded as the band played Feathers off to prison.\u201d</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0</span></p>\n                                <cite>The Northern Echo</cite>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-7\"><table class=\"table event_timetable ap_table blue\" id=\"doors-opening-times\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Date</th><th scope=\"col\">Doors<br/>open</th><th scope=\"col\">Start<br/>time</th><th scope=\"col\">End<br/>time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-uppercase\">1 Nov 2026</th><td>13:30</td><td>14:00</td><td>15:30</td></tr><tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-uppercase\">1 Nov 2026</th><td>15:30</td><td>16:30</td><td>17:40</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    </div>                      \n    <div class=\"event_sidebar grid--item grid--item--2\">\n                   <ul class=\"event_buttons\">\n            <li class=\"tickets_btn\">